### Requests runnable from the VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client.
### The demo scenarios (docs/04 section 8) are added next to this file in P1-QA-01.
@edge = http://localhost:8080
@api = {{edge}}/api/v1

### Health (operationId getHealth): 200 {"status":"ok","checks":{"db":"ok","inventory":"ok|degraded"}}
GET {{api}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Unknown API path: edge answers problem+json 404 NOT_FOUND, never HTML
GET {{edge}}/api
Accept: application/json
